# 4K HDR TV - 3840x2160 @ 144 Hz, VRR (FreeSync)
# Apply with: hyprmoncfg apply tv-gaming-4k
# Edit the HDMI/DP output name to match `hyprctl monitors` on your box.
# Scale 1.5: 38-52px shell chrome stays readable from the couch. Use 2 for
# larger UI (1080p-effective) or 1 only if you sit desk-close to the panel.
monitor=HDMI-A-1,3840x2160@144,auto,1.5,vrr,2,hdr
